# Episode 5 ending "No Problem at All", ~40 s (docs/design/script-episodes-4-8/e5m4.md, shot list N1-N6; beats from
# docs/design/mission-e5-04.md D9 / Cinematic hooks `ep5_ending`, episode7-opening.md 3 H18-H19, campaign-outline.md 3.5).
# The orrery dome, years ago: the Master gives Vessa and Malrik the two harbour cities ("Keep them in peace." / "Of
# course, Master! No problem at all!" / "None whatsoever."); Vessa runs for the stair ("I'm taking the gold one!");
# the red and the violet flames knock into each other over his hand; Vey at the door: "You heard her."; present day:
# Vessa ties Vey's sword-knot back on, Malrik's candle still burns; the title card.
# Text source for i18n / voices: data/voice/lines/ep5_ending.json (the same text as the lines below).
# e5m4 is not built: not in CampaignState.STORY_FILMS yet (play it with run_cine.ps1 play ep5_ending).
# Sets: forge_citadel (the orrery dome, intact: its S06 mark, its Master puppet, its swordsman puppet = Vey in his
# prime); forge_watch_keep (Emberfall in snow) and forge_intro_malrik (the crypt, its candle) for the present-day tail.
# Stand-ins: Vessa at 17 / Malrik at 18 = the wizard models at 0.9 scale (no `apprentice` looks yet).
# Axis: the dome: the Master (north) - the two apprentices (south); every camera stays east (+X) of that line.
cine ep5_ending  title="Episode 5: The Spark and the Candle"  letterbox=2.39  seed=503  length=38..43
use set forge_citadel
use music res://assets/audio/music/music_menu.wav  vol=-21
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=narrator
cast  vey       capsule  at=(4, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=vey
cast  y_vessa   res://art/units/wizards/vessa.tscn   at=(-13.7, 48, -4.0)  yaw=0  scale=0.9  set=forge_citadel
cast  y_malrik  res://art/units/wizards/malrik.tscn  at=(-12.3, 48, -4.0)  yaw=0  scale=0.9  set=forge_citadel

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the orrery dome, years ago
# Dolly in behind the Master at the orrery: four little flames light one by one over his open hand
shot S06 6.0  in=fade_white:0.6
  at 0.0  hide y_vessa
  at 0.0  hide y_malrik
  at 0.0  vfx flames scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/four_flames.tscn at=(-11.6, 51.2, -3.2) life=6.0 scale=0.8
# MS two-shot over the Master's shoulder: Vessa and Malrik before him; he gives the charge
shot N2 10.0  cam=static  from=(-9.4, 50.0, -0.8)  look=(-13.0, 49.3, -4.0)  fov=38  faces=y_vessa,y_malrik
  at 0.0  show y_vessa
  at 0.0  show y_malrik
  at 0.0  teleport master  to=(-13, 48, -1.4)  yaw=180
  at 0.3  line master "Vessa. Malrik. The two harbour cities are yours now. Keep them in peace."  dur=5.2
  at 5.8  anim y_vessa set_expression  arg=smile
  at 5.8  line vessa "Of course, Master! No problem at all!"  dur=2.2
  at 8.1  line malrik "None whatsoever."  dur=1.3
  at 8.1  anim y_malrik set_expression  arg=smile
# WS the dome from the orrery's east side: Vessa already halfway to the stair; Malrik walks after her, slow
shot N3 6.0  cam=static  from=(-6.0, 50.6, -4.0)  look=(-13.5, 49.0, -1.0)  fov=52  faces=y_vessa,y_malrik
  at 0.0  move y_vessa  to=(-15.0, 48, 2.0)  speed=2.2
  at 0.5  line vessa "I'm taking the gold one!"  dur=1.8
  at 1.4  move y_malrik  to=(-14.2, 48, 0.4)  speed=0.9
  at 3.0  line malrik "Naturally."  dur=1.2
# MS the Master, back to camera: the red and the violet flame knock into each other; Vey's dry voice from the door
shot N4 6.0  cam=static  from=(-10.4, 50.0, -4.6)  look=(-14.0, 49.4, 0.8)  fov=44  faces=master
  at 0.0  hide y_vessa
  at 0.0  hide y_malrik
  at 0.0  vfx red  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/fire_burst.tscn  at=(-12.9, 49.9, -1.9)  life=1.2  scale=0.2
  at 1.4  vfx clash  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/regalia_burst.tscn  at=(-12.9, 50.0, -1.9)  life=1.0  scale=0.15
  at 0.4  line vey "You heard her. No problem at all."  dur=2.6
  at 3.4  line master "I heard them both."  dur=2.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- present day
# Emberfall in snow: grown Vessa ties Vey's sword-knot back on her hilt
shot N5 3.5  set=forge_watch_keep  cam=frame "ms on vessa, 3/4 left, eye"  in=fade_black:0.5
  at 0.0  fade color=#e8eef8  alpha=0.25  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide guard_w
  at 0.0  hide guard_e
  at 0.0  anim vessa set_expression  arg=smile
  at 0.5  line narrator "Three years later he was gone, and the peace he gave them was the first thing they spent."  dur=5.8
# Dissolve: grown Malrik's violet candle still burning, unpinched
shot N5B 3.5  set=forge_intro_malrik  cam=static  from=(4.6, 1.6, 4.4)  look=(2.6, 1.3, 1.8)  fov=36  in=blend:0.8
  at 0.0  fade color=#0b0c26  alpha=0.3  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide sknight
  at 0.0  hide hexweaver
  at 0.0  hide shade
  at 0.0  hide army_host
  at 0.0  hide army_fallen
  at 0.0  hide fx_vortex
  at 0.0  hide fx_tendrils
  at 0.0  hide fx_master
  at 0.0  hide fx_crown
  at 0.0  hide malrik_young
  at 0.0  teleport malrik  to=(2.2, 0, 1.6)  yaw=60
  at 0.0  vfx flame  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/ember.tscn  at=(3.4, 1.1, 2.2)  life=3.5  scale=0.2
# The title card on black
shot N6 5.0  cam=static  from=(-13, 50.5, 4.4)  look=(-13, 50.2, -4)  fov=44  in=fade_black:0.6
  at 0.0  fade color=#000000  alpha=1  time=0.05
  at 0.4  title "Episode 5" sub="The Spark and the Candle" time=3.8
